杀，亦可对敌人从造成出其不意的方向造成伤害","en":"A long saber with a sharp hook at the tip, capable of easily dragging enemy generals from their horses for the kill, or striking enemies from unexpected angles"},"atkVal":"10","price":"8500","slot":{"zh":"武器","en":"Weapon"}},{"id":"WP1013805","name":{"zh":"锦绣布衣","en":"Embroidered Cloth Robe"},"level":"0","description":{"zh":"采用了普通的面料并进行了纹饰处理的布衣，衣服的边缘处也添加了简单的纹饰。","en":"A cloth garment made of ordinary fabric adorned with patterns, with simple decorative trim added along the edges."},"defenceVal":"2","mp":"340","price":"1200","slot":{"zh":"护甲","en":"Armor"}},{"id":"WP1028705","name":{"zh":"发带","en":"Headband"},"level":"0","description":{"zh":"民间随处可见的头带，摘下来看不过是一块布料而已。","en":"A common headband seen everywhere, nothing more than a strip of cloth when removed."},"mp":"100","evade":"1","price":"200","slot":{"zh":"头盔","en":"Helmet"}},{"id":"WP1001015","name":{"zh":"汗血","en":"Sweatblood"},"level":"2","description":{"zh":"西域进贡的纯种汗血宝马，皮肤薄，血管可见，冲刺时如流血汗。","en":"A purebred blood-sweating horse presented as tribute from the Western Regions, with thin skin and visible veins that appear to sweat blood at full gallop."},"price":"10000","slot":{"zh":"坐骑","en":"Mount"}}],"family":{"father":{"label":{"zh":"父亲","en":"Father"},"people":[{"id":"WJ1043215","code":"0"}]}},"clans":[{"id":"GI113015","name":{"zh":"鲜卑拓跋氏","en":"The Tuoba clan of Xianbei"},"years":["0","999"],"desc":{"zh":"出自东胡，鲜卑族北部支系。东汉前期从大兴安岭北段南迁至呼伦贝尔草原，后继续西迁至阴山一带。三国时期鲜卑北部最强部落，北魏皇族先祖。拓跋力微在位期间吞并没鹿回部，拥有控弦之士二十余万。魏甘露三年，拓跋力微宣布承认曹魏为宗主国。其子孙在十六国时期建立代国，后发展为统一北方的北魏。","en":"Originating from the Donghu, a northern branch of the Xianbei people. In the early Eastern Han, they migrated South from the northern reaches of the Greater Khingan Mountains to the Hulunbuir Grasslands, later pressing West toward the Yin Mountains region. During the Three Kingdoms period, they stood as the most formidable Xianbei tribe in the North, serving as the imperial forebears of the Northern Wei dynasty. Under the rule of Tuoba Liwei, they annexed the Moluhui tribe, commanding over 200,000 mounted archers. In the third year of the Ganlu era of Wei, Tuoba Liwei formally acknowledged Cao Wei as suzerain. His descendants went on to establish the state of Dai during the Sixteen Kingdoms era, which eventually evolved into the Northern Wei dynasty that unified the North."},"talent":{"military":"9","commerce":"3","politics":"8"}},{"id":"GI112915","name":{"zh":"鲜卑秃发氏","en":"The Tufa clan of the Xianbei"},"years":["0","999"],"desc":{"zh":"出自东胡，鲜卑族西部支系，与拓跋部同源。三世纪初，首领秃发匹孤率部从塞北阴山迁徙至河西地区。三国后期，其部由邓艾迁至雍凉二州交界地带。至西晋时其首领秃发树机能发动大规模反晋起义。十六国时期，秃发乌孤建立南凉政权。","en":"Originating from the Donghu as a western branch of the Xianbei people, sharing common roots with the Tuoba tribe. In the early 3rd century, their chieftain Tufa Pigu led the tribe from Mount Yin north of the frontier to the Hexi region. In the late Three Kingdoms period, their tribe was relocated by Deng Ai to the border of Yong and Liang provinces. In the Western Jin dynasty, their chieftain Tufa Shujineng launched a massive rebellion against Jin. During the Sixteen Kingdoms period, Tufa Wugu established the Southern Liang state."},"talent":{"military":"8","commerce":"2","politics":"5"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":{"name":"秃发寿阗","height":"平均","shape":"精壮"},"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[],"specialNames":[],"vip":{"isVIP":0,"from":"0","to":"0"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"25","startPregnantAge":"0"},"scenarios":[{"story":{"id":"S10802","name":{"zh":"黄巾起义","en":"Yellow Turban Rebellion"},"year":"184","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[76,77,62,61,73,63],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"90","reputation":"3150","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1013805","helmet":"WP1028705","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10215","name":{"zh":"汉末三杰","en":"Three Heroes of the Late Han"},"year":"185","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"stat